-    "- **ParamState**: Updated by optimizers, saved in checkpoints\n",
-    "- **ShortTermState**: Reset each trial, not saved\n",
-    "- **LongTermState**: Saved but not trained\n",
-    "\n",
-    "## State Types\n",
-    "\n",
