-    "\n",
-    "**Use for:** Weights, biases, trainable parameters\n",
-    "\n",
-    "**Characteristics:**\n",
-    "\n",
-    "- Updated by gradient descent\n",
-    "- Saved in model checkpoints\n",
-    "- Persistent across trials\n",
